                        "entry_id": "747e767f-8bec-3da5-a940-1351cbed12f1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "female equivalent of домосе́д (domoséd): female homebody"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "963e106c-232f-444a-8dcb-82f7f753db75",
                                "sense_id": "75732cbb-08c6-3f77-a990-6f769c8c1004",
                                "text": "Ма́менька с тётенькой, изве́стно, домосе́дки и не зна́ют того́, что я оди́н по десяти́ челове́к на оди́н кула́к колоти́л в бою́.",
                                "translation": "Mama and my aunt were notorious homebodies and didn’t know that I alone used to beat ten men with one fist in a fistfight.",
                                "english": "Mama and my aunt were notorious homebodies and didn’t know that I alone used to beat ten men with one fist in a fistfight."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
